flowchart TD
    Start([Controller Starts]) --> WatchResources[Watch GatewayClass, Gateway,<br/>Route Resources, and Policies]

    WatchResources --> EventReceived{Event<br/>Received?}
    EventReceived -->|GatewayClass| ProcessGC[Process GatewayClass]
    EventReceived -->|Gateway| ProcessGW[Process Gateway]
    EventReceived -->|Route| ProcessRoute[Process Route]
    EventReceived -->|BackendTLSPolicy| ProcessBTP[Process BackendTLSPolicy]

    %% GatewayClass Processing (Simplified - No Listeners Here!)
    ProcessGC --> CheckController{Controller<br/>Name Matches?}
    CheckController -->|No| IgnoreGC[Ignore Event]
    CheckController -->|Yes| ValidateParams{Validate<br/>ParametersRef}
    ValidateParams -->|Invalid| SetGCRejected[Set Accepted=False<br/>Reason: InvalidParameters]
    ValidateParams -->|Valid| SetGCAccepted[Set Accepted=True<br/>Reason: Accepted]
    ValidateParams -->|No Params| SetGCAccepted
    SetGCRejected --> UpdateGCStatus[Update GatewayClass Status]
    SetGCAccepted --> UpdateGCStatus
    UpdateGCStatus --> WatchResources
    IgnoreGC --> WatchResources

    %% Gateway Processing (This is where Listeners are!)
    ProcessGW --> CheckGWClass{GatewayClass<br/>Exists & Accepted?}
    CheckGWClass -->|No| SetGWNotAccepted[Set Accepted=False<br/>Reason: InvalidGatewayClass]
    CheckGWClass -->|Yes| ValidateListeners[Validate Listeners<br/>from Gateway.spec]

    ValidateListeners --> CheckDistinct{All Listeners<br/>Distinct?}
    CheckDistinct -->|No| MarkConflicted[Mark Conflicted Listeners<br/>Set Conflicted=True]
    CheckDistinct -->|Yes| ValidateListener[Validate Each Listener]

    MarkConflicted --> PartialAccept{Any Valid<br/>Listeners?}
    PartialAccept -->|No| RejectGW[Reject Gateway<br/>Set Accepted=False]
    PartialAccept -->|Yes| AcceptPartial[Accept Non-Conflicted<br/>Set ListenersNotValid]

    ValidateListener --> CheckProtocol{Protocol<br/>Supported?}
    CheckProtocol -->|No| SetUnsupported[Set Listener Accepted=False<br/>Reason: UnsupportedProtocol]
    CheckProtocol -->|Yes| CheckTLS{TLS Config<br/>Valid?}

    CheckTLS -->|Invalid| SetTLSInvalid[Set ResolvedRefs=False<br/>Reason: InvalidCertificateRef]
    CheckTLS -->|Valid/None| SetListenerAccepted[Set Listener Accepted=True<br/>Per-Listener Status]
    CheckTLS -->|No TLS| SetListenerAccepted

    SetListenerAccepted --> ProvisionInfra[Provision Infrastructure<br/>Load Balancer, Proxy]
    ProvisionInfra --> UpdateAddresses[Update Gateway.Status.Addresses]
    UpdateAddresses --> SetProgrammed[Set Programmed=True<br/>Reason: Programmed]

    SetGWNotAccepted --> WatchResources
    RejectGW --> WatchResources
    AcceptPartial --> ProvisionInfra
    SetUnsupported --> UpdateGWStatus[Update Gateway Status]
    SetTLSInvalid --> UpdateGWStatus
    UpdateGWStatus --> WatchResources
    SetProgrammed --> WatchResources

    %% Route Processing (HTTPRoute, GRPCRoute, etc.)
    ProcessRoute --> FindParents[Find Parent Gateways<br/>from ParentRefs]
    FindParents --> CheckParent{Parent<br/>Gateway Exists?}
    CheckParent -->|No| SetRouteNotAccepted[Set Accepted=False<br/>Reason: NoMatchingParent]

    CheckParent -->|Yes| MatchListener[Match to Listener by<br/>Port/SectionName/Protocol]
    MatchListener --> CheckAllowed{Route Allowed<br/>on Listener?}

    CheckAllowed -->|Check Namespace| ValidateNS{Namespace<br/>Allowed?}
    ValidateNS -->|No| SetNotAllowed[Set Accepted=False<br/>Reason: NotAllowedByListeners]
    ValidateNS -->|Yes| ValidateKind{Kind<br/>Allowed?}

    ValidateKind -->|No| SetNotAllowed
    ValidateKind -->|Yes| CheckHostname{Hostname<br/>Intersects?}

    CheckHostname -->|No| SetNoHostname[Set Accepted=False<br/>Reason: NoMatchingListenerHostname]
    CheckHostname -->|Yes| ValidateRefs[Validate BackendRefs<br/>and Filters]

    ValidateRefs --> CheckBackends{All Backends<br/>Resolvable?}
    CheckBackends -->|No| SetRefsInvalid[Set ResolvedRefs=False<br/>Reason: BackendNotFound/RefNotPermitted]
    CheckBackends -->|Yes| CheckBackendTLS{BackendTLSPolicy<br/>Exists?}

    CheckBackendTLS -->|Yes| ApplyBackendTLS[Apply Backend TLS Config<br/>from BackendTLSPolicy]
    CheckBackendTLS -->|No| SetRefsValid[Set ResolvedRefs=True]
    ApplyBackendTLS --> SetRefsValid

    SetRefsValid --> ValidateFilters{Filters<br/>Valid?}
    ValidateFilters -->|Invalid| SetPartialInvalid[Set Accepted=True<br/>PartiallyInvalid=True]
    ValidateFilters -->|Valid| SetRouteAccepted[Set Accepted=True<br/>Set Programmed=True]

    SetRouteAccepted --> ConfigureDataPlane[Configure Data Plane<br/>Apply Routing Rules]
    ConfigureDataPlane --> WatchResources

    SetRouteNotAccepted --> WatchResources
    SetNotAllowed --> WatchResources
    SetNoHostname --> WatchResources
    SetRefsInvalid --> ConfigureDataPlane
    SetPartialInvalid --> ConfigureDataPlane

    %% BackendTLSPolicy Processing
    ProcessBTP --> FindTargets[Find Target Services<br/>from TargetRefs]
    FindTargets --> CheckTargetExists{Target<br/>Service Exists?}
    CheckTargetExists -->|No| SetBTPNotAccepted[Set Accepted=False<br/>Reason: InvalidTargetRef]

    CheckTargetExists -->|Yes| CheckConflict{Other Policies<br/>Target Same Service?}
    CheckConflict -->|Yes, Newer| SetBTPConflicted[Set Accepted=False<br/>Reason: Conflicted]
    CheckConflict -->|No/Older| ValidateCACerts{Validate<br/>CACertificateRefs}

    ValidateCACerts -->|Invalid| SetCAInvalid[Set ResolvedRefs=False<br/>Reason: InvalidCertificateRef]
    ValidateCACerts -->|Valid| SetBTPAccepted[Set Accepted=True<br/>Set ResolvedRefs=True]

    SetBTPAccepted --> UpdateBackendConfig[Update Backend TLS Config<br/>in Data Plane]
    UpdateBackendConfig --> TriggerRouteReconcile[Trigger HTTPRoute<br/>Reconciliation]
    TriggerRouteReconcile --> WatchResources

    SetBTPNotAccepted --> WatchResources
    SetBTPConflicted --> WatchResources
    SetCAInvalid --> WatchResources

    %% Styling
    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style WatchResources fill:#e3f2fd
    style SetGCAccepted fill:#c8e6c9
    style SetGCRejected fill:#ffcdd2
    style SetProgrammed fill:#c8e6c9
    style SetRouteAccepted fill:#c8e6c9
    style SetBTPAccepted fill:#c8e6c9
    style RejectGW fill:#ffcdd2
    style ConfigureDataPlane fill:#fff9c4
    style UpdateBackendConfig fill:#fff9c4
    style ValidateListeners fill:#b3e5fc
    style ApplyBackendTLS fill:#b3e5fc
